  "description": "Mid level component package on an electric assist tandem.\nAvailable with road or mountain bars.\nBuilt with the powerful OLI Move motor. The Tailwind II is a more budget friendly electric assist tandem. Like our Tailwind, it is not a motorcycle and you still get the full cycling experience. The motor is quite, smooth, powerful (80nm), and very natural feeling. The high capacity Li-Ion, 522 Wh, battery last for many miles.\n*** This is also available as a frame kit for existing da Vinci owners. You use most of your parts to save money and upgrade to electric assist. Click here for details.",
